      "params": {
        "text": "Audio-reactive shapes\n\n`sound/audio-in` taps the microphone; `sound/amplitude` measures the RMS level. Map the level to a number you can wire into any shape input.\n\nMake noise → the circle grows.\n\n(The first time, allow Floret to use the microphone.)",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Audio-reactive shapes\n\n`sound/audio-in` taps the microphone; `sound/amplitude` measures the RMS level. Map the level to a number you can wire into any shape input.\n\nMake noise → the circle grows.\n\n(The first time, allow Floret to use the microphone.)",
        "width": 440,
